>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn></mrow></semantics></math> mà <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm đầu tiên có tần số tích luỹ lớn hơn hoặc bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>75</mn></semantics></math>. Xét nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math> là nhóm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>  có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\t\tÁp dụng công thức, ta có tứ phân vị thứ ba là\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>55</mn></mrow><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">(giờ)</mtext><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t\t Vậy khoảng tứ phân vị của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm đã cho là\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ul>\n\t\t\tTa thấy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên khoảng tứ phân vị nhóm X lớn hơn nhóm Y.</li></ol>",
